@startuml
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

title Logseq Outliner Block Tree Engine - UML Class Diagram

class Block {
  +uuid: UUID
  +parent: Ref
  +page: Ref
  +order: String
  +title: String
  +collapsed: Boolean
  +createdAt: Long
  +updatedAt: Long
}

class Page {
  +uuid: UUID
  +name: String
  +title: String
}

class TreeNode {
  +block: Block
  +children: List<TreeNode>
  +level: Int
}

class OutlinerCore {
  +saveBlock(block, opts)
  +insertBlocks(blocks, target, opts)
  +deleteBlocks(blocks, opts)
  +moveBlocks(blocks, target, opts)
  +moveBlocksUpDown(blocks, direction, opts)
  +indentOutdentBlocks(blocks, direction, opts)
}

class TreeBuilder {
  +blocksToVecTree(flatBlocks, rootId): List<TreeNode>
  +nonConsecutiveBlocksToVecTree(flatBlocks): List<TreeNode>
}

class OrderService {
  +genKey(left, right): String
  +genNKeys(count, left, right): List<String>
}

class DBHelpers {
  +entity(id): Block
  +getLeftSibling(block): Block
  +getRightSibling(block): Block
  +getDown(block): Block
  +getBlockParents(blockUuid, opts): Seq
}

class DataScriptDB {
  +transact(txData, meta)
}

class ValidationRules {
  +validatePageTitleCharacters(pageTitle, meta)
  +validatePageTitle(pageTitle, meta)
  +validateBlockTitle(db, newTitle, entity)
}

class Transaction {
  +txData: List
  +txMeta: Map
}

Block --> Block : parent ref
Block --> Page : page ref
TreeNode --> Block : wraps
OutlinerCore --> Transaction : builds txData or txMeta
OutlinerCore --> TreeBuilder
OutlinerCore --> OrderService
OutlinerCore --> DBHelpers
OutlinerCore --> DataScriptDB
OutlinerCore --> ValidationRules

note right of OutlinerCore
Structural consistency is preserved across an operation,
but not every operation is one low-level DB transaction.
moveBlocks uses per-block transact calls inside batch mode.
Direct outdent can trigger a follow-on move for right siblings.
end note

note right of ValidationRules
Validation entry points are sourced from validate.cljs.
UUID immutability is asserted in core.cljs save logic,
not in the validation namespace.
end note
@enduml
